{"candidateAnswer":"Yes, John is patriotic.","evidence":"[D8:18 | 6:03 pm on 6 March, 2023] John: Wow, having symbols of travel memories in our homes is so cool! Last week I retook the aptitude test with some great results, and I feel drawn to serving my country in this way.\n[D8:20 | 6:03 pm on 6 March, 2023] John: Yeah, I chatted with my family and friends about it. They've been supportive and understand why I want to volunteer. I'm really proud to have this opportunity!","itemId":"urn:uuid:5728af97-f2ab-54e9-becf-d2b8ce468d1b","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:c4c980b829d934c8807fe59a9307adc61cc603ead4ea19e5fa965b2e0d7ecb7f","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Would John be considered a patriotic person?","referenceAnswer":"Yes","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"c4c980b829d934c8807fe59a9307adc61cc603ead4ea19e5fa965b2e0d7ecb7f"}}]}